         "\n\n<f3>Briefing:<f1> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> standoff against each other in the desolate city of Naxos. Each team is equipped with a vehicle replicator, inventory stations, and a command station as well. <f1>Tip: <f3>Use the fallen buildings as ramps! <f2>Map by Ghost";